{"4549600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Skate Mates", "steam_appid": 4549600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4812680], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4549600/extras/ccecccc0f6ef4bbe0c07416a9d88582f.avif?t=1787702447\" width=645 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Test your patience (and your friendships) by skating through a seemingly endless obstacle course where you only have control over one skate. Teamwork and communication are the only way through!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4549600/extras/59317ddc8a82d3cd3b1c2e06c40f7ec1.poster.avif?t=1787702447\" width=800 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4549600/extras/59317ddc8a82d3cd3b1c2e06c40f7ec1.webm?t=1787702447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4549600/extras/59317ddc8a82d3cd3b1c2e06c40f7ec1.mp4?t=1787702447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab a friend or ride solo down a devastatingly difficult obstacle course. You will get crushed, sliced, fall, trip, and run into the occasional cactus as your teamwork is put to the ultimate test. Each player controls a skate, and through teamwork and persistence, it’s your job to safely guide your protagonists through each biome to safety.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4549600/extras/784f7c94bc164a201974226e7a021c92.avif?t=1787702447\" width=645 height=210 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>We're Gonna Skate To One Song and One Song Only...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo or Co-op</strong> – Master the course alone or hand control of the right skate to a friend for chaotic co-op.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>300,000+ Outfit Combinations</strong> – Customize your skater with hats, tops, pants, and skates to create the perfect look.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Courses &amp; Biomes</strong> – Journey through deserts, forests, icy peaks, lava fields, and more, each with its own challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More Than Just Skating</strong> – Take on unique challenges and mechanics that change how you play, with each course bringing something different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adjustable Difficulty</strong> – Fine-tune the challenge to match your skill level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local Shared Keyboard Co-op</strong> – Play together on a single keyboard using WASD and the arrow keys.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-Based Chaos</strong> – Expect spectacular face plants, plenty of yelling, and the occasional rage quit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speedrun &amp; Leaderboards</strong> – Set record times, chase highscores, and prove you're the best.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4549600/extras/6d296585d8ba0019f96720e1770e85e8.poster.avif?t=1787702447\" width=800 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4549600/extras/6d296585d8ba0019f96720e1770e85e8.webm?t=1787702447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4549600/extras/6d296585d8ba0019f96720e1770e85e8.mp4?t=1787702447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solo or Co-op</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the course alone, or hand control of the right rollerblade to a friend for a chaotic co-op experience where teamwork is the only way to stay upright.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>300,000+ Outfit Combinations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and mix hundreds of hats, tops, pants, and rollerblades to create the perfect look before inevitably face planting.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Courses &amp; Biomes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through deserts, forests, icy peaks, lava fields, and more. Every course introduces new obstacles, mechanics, and challenges to overcome.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Adjustable Difficulty</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're after a relaxed ride or a keyboard-snapping challenge, tailor the difficulty to suit your playstyle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Local Shared Keyboard Co-op</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No extra controllers required. Two players can jump straight into the action using a single keyboard with WASD and the arrow keys.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Physics-Based Chaos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every stumble, wipeout, and miraculous save is powered by unpredictable physics, creating hilarious moments every run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Speedrun &amp; Leaderboards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect your route, set record times, and climb the leaderboards to prove you're the best.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4549600/extras/2c228432661c6fef7cfc09c092f3577c.poster.avif?t=1787702447\" width=800 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4549600/extras/2c228432661c6